{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56600","headline":"秋日在县望雨仰赠郑司马 · 赵志","name":"秋日在县望雨仰赠郑司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴云凝素序，凉雨散秋旻。\n望山疑拥雾，[瞻]（赡）野若飘尘。\n始飞鸣凤岭，还洒饮龙津。\n宿草沾逾润，寒花濯更新。\n色黯虚庭夕，声喧危砌晨。\n索居劳望美，离思切依仁。\n徒怀[伐]（〖代〗从周改）木唱，独敛向隅嚬。\n方惭灌坛术，空慕颍川巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}